{"1440":["<div class=\"rb dk nb\" style=\"background:#1b2a4a\"><h4 style=\"color:#fff;background:#1b2a4a;padding:0 .3em;border-radius:4px;font-size:1.75em;font-weight:700;background:#1b2a4a;padding:.25em .5em;border-radius:5px\">Resistor Colour Code</h4><p style=\"color:#fff;background:#1b2a4a;padding:0 .3em;border-radius:4px;font-size:1.11em;background:#1b2a4a;padding:.25em .5em;border-radius:5px\">TNEB AE (EEE) · Memory Book · Visual Trick</p></div><h4 style=\"color:#7b1fa2;font-size:1.52em;font-weight:700\">Mnemonic:  B B R O Y  of  Great Britain had a  Very  Good  Wife</h4><p style=\"color:#14202e\">Black 0 · Brown 1 · Red 2 · Orange 3 · Yellow 4 · Green 5 · Blue 6 · Violet 7 · Grey 8 · White 9 · Gold ±5 % · Silver ±10 %</p><div class=\"rb\" style=\"border-color:#dbe2ec\"><div class=\"rtw\"><table class=\"rt rc\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Colour</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Digit</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Multiplier</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Tolerance</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Code</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Temp. coeff. ppm/K</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\"><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#111111\"></i>Black</td><td data-h=\"Digit\" style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\">0</td><td data-h=\"Multiplier\" style=\"color:#14202e\">×1</td><td data-h=\"Tolerance\" style=\"color:#14202e\">—</td><td data-h=\"Code\" style=\"color:#14202e\">—</td><td data-h=\"Temp. coeff. ppm/K\" style=\"color:#14202e\">250</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\"><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#7b4a1e\"></i>Brown</td><td data-h=\"Digit\" style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\">1</td><td data-h=\"Multiplier\" style=\"color:#14202e\">×10</td><td data-h=\"Tolerance\" style=\"color:#14202e\">±1 %</td><td data-h=\"Code\" style=\"color:#14202e\">F</td><td data-h=\"Temp. coeff. ppm/K\" style=\"color:#14202e\">100</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\"><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#d32f2f\"></i>Red</td><td data-h=\"Digit\" style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\">2</td><td data-h=\"Multiplier\" style=\"color:#14202e\">×100</td><td data-h=\"Tolerance\" style=\"color:#14202e\">±2 %</td><td data-h=\"Code\" style=\"color:#14202e\">G</td><td data-h=\"Temp. coeff. ppm/K\" style=\"color:#14202e\">50</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\"><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#f57c00\"></i>Orange</td><td data-h=\"Digit\" style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\">3</td><td data-h=\"Multiplier\" style=\"color:#14202e\">×1 k</td><td data-h=\"Tolerance\" style=\"color:#14202e\">—</td><td data-h=\"Code\" style=\"color:#14202e\">—</td><td data-h=\"Temp. coeff. ppm/K\" style=\"color:#14202e\">15</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\"><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#fbc02d\"></i>Yellow</td><td data-h=\"Digit\" style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\">4</td><td data-h=\"Multiplier\" style=\"color:#14202e\">×10 k</td><td data-h=\"Tolerance\" style=\"color:#14202e\">—</td><td data-h=\"Code\" style=\"color:#14202e\">—</td><td data-h=\"Temp. coeff. ppm/K\" style=\"color:#14202e\">25</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\"><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#2e7d32\"></i>Green</td><td data-h=\"Digit\" style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\">5</td><td data-h=\"Multiplier\" style=\"color:#14202e\">×100 k</td><td data-h=\"Tolerance\" style=\"color:#14202e\">±0.5 %</td><td data-h=\"Code\" style=\"color:#14202e\">D</td><td data-h=\"Temp. coeff. ppm/K\" style=\"color:#14202e\">20</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\"><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#1565c0\"></i>Blue</td><td data-h=\"Digit\" style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\">6</td><td data-h=\"Multiplier\" style=\"color:#14202e\">×1 M</td><td data-h=\"Tolerance\" style=\"color:#14202e\">±0.25 %</td><td data-h=\"Code\" style=\"color:#14202e\">C</td><td data-h=\"Temp. coeff. ppm/K\" style=\"color:#14202e\">10</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\"><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#7b1fa2\"></i>Violet</td><td data-h=\"Digit\" style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\">7</td><td data-h=\"Multiplier\" style=\"color:#14202e\">×10 M</td><td data-h=\"Tolerance\" style=\"color:#14202e\">±0.1 %</td><td data-h=\"Code\" style=\"color:#14202e\">B</td><td data-h=\"Temp. coeff. ppm/K\" style=\"color:#14202e\">5</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\"><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#757575\"></i>Grey</td><td data-h=\"Digit\" style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\">8</td><td data-h=\"Multiplier\" style=\"color:#14202e\">×100 M</td><td data-h=\"Tolerance\" style=\"color:#14202e\">±0.05 %</td><td data-h=\"Code\" style=\"color:#14202e\">A</td><td data-h=\"Temp. coeff. ppm/K\" style=\"color:#14202e\">1</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\"><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#f5f5f5\"></i>White</td><td data-h=\"Digit\" style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\">9</td><td data-h=\"Multiplier\" style=\"color:#14202e\">×1 G</td><td data-h=\"Tolerance\" style=\"color:#14202e\">—</td><td data-h=\"Code\" style=\"color:#14202e\">—</td><td data-h=\"Temp. coeff. ppm/K\" style=\"color:#14202e\">—</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\"><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#c9a227\"></i>Gold</td><td data-h=\"Digit\" style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\">—</td><td data-h=\"Multiplier\" style=\"color:#14202e\">×0.1</td><td data-h=\"Tolerance\" style=\"color:#14202e\">±5 %</td><td data-h=\"Code\" style=\"color:#14202e\">J</td><td data-h=\"Temp. coeff. ppm/K\" style=\"color:#14202e\">—</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\"><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#b0b0b0\"></i>Silver</td><td data-h=\"Digit\" style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\">—</td><td data-h=\"Multiplier\" style=\"color:#14202e\">×0.01</td><td data-h=\"Tolerance\" style=\"color:#14202e\">±10 %</td><td data-h=\"Code\" style=\"color:#14202e\">K</td><td data-h=\"Temp. coeff. ppm/K\" style=\"color:#14202e\">—</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\"><i class=\"sw\" style=\"background:#ffffff\"></i>None</td><td data-h=\"Digit\" style=\"color:#14202e;font-weight:700\">—</td><td data-h=\"Multiplier\" style=\"color:#14202e\">—</td><td data-h=\"Tolerance\" style=\"color:#14202e\">±20 %</td><td data-h=\"Code\" style=\"color:#14202e\">M</td><td data-h=\"Temp. coeff. ppm/K\" style=\"color:#14202e\">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h4 style=\"color:#1b2a4a;font-size:1.28em;font-weight:700\">4-band:  Yellow Violet Red Gold</h4><i data-k=\"0\"></i><h4 style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-size:1.40em;font-weight:700\">= 47 × 100 = 4.7 kΩ ± 5 %</h4><h4 style=\"color:#1b2a4a;font-size:1.28em;font-weight:700\">5-band:  Brown Black Black Red Brown</h4><i data-k=\"1\"></i><h4 style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-size:1.40em;font-weight:700\">= 100 × 100 = 10 kΩ ± 1 %</h4><h4 style=\"color:#1b2a4a;font-size:1.28em;font-weight:700\">6-band:  Red Red Black Brown Brown Red</h4><i data-k=\"2\"></i><h4 style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-size:1.40em;font-weight:700\">= 220 × 10 = 2.2 kΩ ± 1 %, 50 ppm/K</h4><div class=\"rb nb\" style=\"background:#fff1c9\"><p>• Gold multiplier ×0.1 and silver ×0.01 → values below 10 Ω (e.g. Red Red Gold = 2.2 Ω).</p><p>• No 4th band → ±20 %.  Exam trap: Grey = 8 and White = 9 (not 9 and 8); Violet = 7.</p><p>• Letter code on SMD/schematics: 4K7 = 4.7 kΩ, R47 = 0.47 Ω, 1M0 = 1 MΩ; 3-digit SMD &#x27;472&#x27; = 47 × 10² = 4.7 kΩ.</p></div><p>• 4-band: digit · digit · multiplier · tolerance.   5-band: 3 digits · multiplier · tolerance.   6-band: + temperature coefficient.</p><p>• Start reading from the end where the band is nearest the edge; the tolerance band (gold/silver) has a wider gap before it.</p>",[["img/refp/colour-0.webp",740,407,0,740,132,409],["img/refp/colour-0.webp",740,407,138,740,131,409],["img/refp/colour-0.webp",740,407,275,740,132,409]]]}